 they will pervert the spirit, but not the letter, of any command they are given, whenever possible. note: if an invoker creates a magical effect containing an intensity 3 or 5 application of sandestin, then his/her trained in is reduced by one for its duration (which may be permanent). lost in and skill levels are restored when the effect stops (if the effect is obliterated — eg. by instil — then the loss is permanent). if the invoker improves his/her in with experience, then any loss he/she is currently suffering as a result of this rule becomes permanent."><td><a href="/magic-sandestin/#app-judging-sandestin">Judging Sandestin</a></td><td><a href="/magic-sandestin/">Sandestin</a></td><td align="center">3</td><td align="center">§17A4</td></tr><tr data-search="lend vigor essence the invoker may transfer as many fatigue points as he/she wishes (and has) from him/herself to the target (who must be of the invoker's race) of the spell."><td><a href="/magic-essence/#app-lend-vigor">Lend Vigor</a></td><td><a href="/magic-essence/">Essence</a></td><td align="center">0</td><td align="center">§14B1</td></tr><tr data-search="lend vigor (any race) essence as lend vigor (§14b1), but the target may be of any race."><td><a href="/magic-essence/#app-lend-vigor-any-race">Lend Vigor (Any Race)</a></td><td><a href="/magic-essence/">Essence</a></td><td align="center">1</td><td align="center">§14B3</td></tr><tr data-search="lesser animation apportation manipulate a jointed object massing no more than one kilogram as though it were a marionette. (bestowed, controlled.)"><td><a href="/magic-apportation/#app-lesser-animation">Lesser Animation</a></td><td><a href="/magic-apportation/">Apportation</a></td><td align="center">1</td><td align="center">§3B4</td></tr><tr data-search="lesser curse cancellation the invoker may afflict his/her target with a magical backfire (roll on the magical backfire table, treating any roll of 01-62 as: the target is stunned, and must recover normally; duration: immediate)."><td><a href="/magic-cancellation/#app-lesser-curse">Lesser Curse</a></td><td><a href="/magic-cancellation/">Cancellation</a></td><td align="center">3</td><td align="center">§4A5</td></tr><tr data-search="lesser curse removal cancellation the invoker may remove the effects of a magical backfire (other than an effect reversal) from him/herself or his/her target (duration: immediate)."><td><a href="/magic-cancellation/#app-lesser-curse-removal">Lesser Curse Removal</a></td><td><a href="/magic-cancellation/">Cancellation</a></td><td align="center">4</td><td align="center">§4A7</td></tr><tr data-search="lesser earth creation earth create/remove a volume of earth, gravel, rock, or sand (at rest — eg. in a pile on the ground, but not in the air or on an object unable to support it) occupying a volume no greater than 1m×1m×1m (fixed)."><td><a href="/magic-earth/#app-lesser-earth-creation">Lesser Earth Creation</a></td><td><a href="/magic-earth/">Earth</a></td><td align="center">0</td><td align="center">§8B1</td></tr><tr data-search="lesser extension dimension quadruple the duration of any non-immediate magical effect of which this application is a part (fixed)."><td><a href="/magic-dimension/#app-lesser-extension">Lesser Extension</a></td><td><a href="/magic-dimension/">Dimension</a></td><td align="center">1</td><td align="center">§11B2</td></tr><tr data-search="lesser silence sound silence any sound no louder than quiet speech (fixed)."><td><a href="/magic-sound/#app-lesser-silence">Lesser Silence</a></td><td><a href="/magic-sound/">Sound</a></td><td align="center">0</td><td align="center">§19B5</td></tr><tr data-search="lesser summons summon give the nearest creature of a given description, so long as it is within 1km of the invoker, a desire to travel as quickly as it is safely able to the point the invoker occupied at the time of invocation (fixed)."><td><a href="/magic-summon/#app-lesser-summons">Lesser Summons</a></td><td><a href="/magic-summon/">Summon</a></td><td align="center">0</td><td align="center">§20B1</td></tr><tr data-search="lesser teleportation apportation the invoker may instantaneously transport him/herself to any point within range and line of sight (immediate). !!! (a matter for debate. maybe !!)"><td><a href="/magic-apportation/#app-lesser-teleportation">Lesser Teleportation</a></td><td><a href="/magic-apportation/">Apportation</a></td><td align="center">3</td><td align="center">§3A7</td></tr><tr data-search="levitation apportation levitate an object massing no more than 100kg about three metres above the ground. the target rises slowly when the application takes effect, and slowly falls once the effect ceases."><td><a href="/magic-apportation/#app-levitation">Levitation</a></td><td><a href="/magic-apportation/">Apportation</a></td><td align="center">2</td><td align="center">§3A15</td></tr><tr data-search="light control image brighten or dim one lamp, equivalent to a torch or lantern (so that it becomes twice as bright, or ceases to give off light; controlled)."><td><a href="/magic-image/#app-light-control">Light Control</a></td><td><a href="/magic-image/">Image</a></td><td align="center">0</td><td align="center">§13B3</td></tr><tr data-search="light touch touch inflict or remove a sensation equivalent in intensity to a light touch, a st1 grasp/push, or a gentle cool/warm breeze (controlled)."><td><a href="/magic-touch/#app-light-touch">Light Touch</a></td><td><a href="/magic-touch/">Touch</a></td><td align="center">0</td><td align="center">§21B1</td></tr><tr data-search="lightning bolt air create a lightning bolt 1m wide extending from the invoker to a point within range (immediate). anyone touched by the lightning bolt, or placed in electrical contact with it, takes dc6 and is automatically stunned. if he/she achieves a qr10 on his/her pr roll (for the damage) he/she dies of heart failure, and must be revived by a skilled person (at least if in low-tech surroundings) within a minute. a lightning bolt damages through heat and moisture."><td><a href="/magic-air/#app-lightning-bolt">Lightning Bolt</a></td><td><a href="/magic-air/">Air</a></td><td align="center">3</td><td align="center">§2A12</td></tr><tr data-search="link dimension increase the duration of any non-immediate magical effect of which this application is a part indefinitely, by paying a continuing fatigue cost for the effect. the invoker must pay fatigue equal to the energy of the effect (were this application not a part of it) at intervals equal to the effect's normal duration (ie. the duration of the effect without this application). the effect is then treated as controlled, whether or not it would otherwise be controlled, insofar as the invoker must concentrate on the effect he/she is sustaining or it will dissipate as though its time had elapsed (similarly the invoker may end the effect at any time); this does not prevent the invoker from controlling those aspects of the effect which would normally be controlled otherwise. the invoker begins paying fatigue when the effect's duration would normally expire. a character maintaining an effect in the above manner cannot regain fatigue by resting."><td><a href="/magic-dimension/#app-link">Link</a></td><td><a href="/magic-dimension/">Dimension</a></td><td align="center">1</td><td align="center">§11B3</td></tr><tr data-search="mass age time age multiple targets, otherwise as age (§23a6)."><td><a href="/magic-time/#app-mass-age">Mass Age</a></td><td><a href="/magic-time/">Time</a></td><td align="center">4</td><td align="center">§23A6</td></tr><tr data-search="mass pain essence the invoker may cause pain to all within 10m, forcing all people and creatures in this region to make a pr roll (modified by -1 per additional application simultaneously affecting a given target) or become stunned."><td><a href="/magic-essence/#app-mass-pain">Mass Pain</a></td><td><a href="/magic-essence/">Essence</a></td><td align="center">3</td><td align="center">§22A10</td></tr><tr data-search="mass rouse essence the invoker may immediately unstun any or all targets within 10m (his/her discretion)."><td><a href="/magic-essence/#app-mass-rouse">Mass Rouse</a></td><td><a href="/magic-essence/">Essence</a></td><td align="center">4</td><td align="center">§14A10</td></tr><tr data-search="master abeyance abeyance delay a magical effect of which this application is part indefinitely (controlled or fixed, bestowed)."><td><a href="/magic-abeyance/#app-master-abeyance">Master Abeyance</a></td><td><a href="/magic-abeyance/">Abeyance</a></td><td align="center">2</td><td align="center">§1A3</td></tr><tr data-search="master extension dimension increase, by a factor of twenty-five hundred, the duration of any non-immediate magical effect of which this application is a part (fixed)."><td><a href="/magic-dimension/#app-master-extension">Master Extension</a></td><td><a href="/magic-dimension/">Dimension</a></td><td align="center">4</td><td align="center">§11A7</td></tr><tr data-search="master gate seal cancellation render a volume up to 10m×10m×10m impervious to either entry or exit via &quot;gate&quot; applications — even via existing gates — of the apportation fundamental (bestowed, duration: 1 day)."><td><a href="/magic-cancellation/#app-master-gate-seal">Master Gate Seal</a></td><td><a href="/magic-cancellation/">Cancellation</a></td><td align="center">4</td><td align="center">§4A8</td></tr><tr data-search="master teleportation seal cancellation render a volume up to 10m×10m×10m impervious to either entry or exit via &quot;teleportation&quot; applications of the apportation fundamental (bestowed, duration: 1 day)."><td><a href="/magic-cancellation/#app-master-teleportation-seal">Master Teleportation Seal</a></td><td><a href="/magic-cancellation/">Cancellation</a></td><td align="center">3</td><td align="center">§4A6</td></tr><tr data-search="matrix creation dimension create a &quot;matrix&quot; for any effect of which this application is a part, in some chosen object within range. the matrix may be used by a character to invoke the effect (without this application) by performing the number of incant actions which would normally be required to invoke it (ie. its energy were this application not a part of it) while holding (and pointing, or whatever) the object containing the matrix. the use of any matrix, even one made by a sorceror, requires the presence of the props associated with its component applications. non-consumed props may be incorporated into the matrix; consumed props will have to be supplied by the user. after performing the requisite number of incant actions, the matrix user makes an incant roll as though invoking the effect him/herself (even a non-magician may do this): - qr1-4 — successful invocation. - qr7 — successful invocation (although the effect will be very easy to resist), and a d20 backfire. - qr10 — a d100 backfire, and the destruction of the matrix. optional (even if casting is in use): casting can be used instead of incantation, as above, by performing a single cast action. note: after attempting (successfully or otherwise) the invocation of an effect including this application, the magician will be extremely fatigued, suffering a -1 modifier to all activity; to recover, he/she must pay 50 eps, and rest for at least one week, without interruption."><td><a href="/magic-dimension/#app-matrix-creation">Matrix Creation</a></td><td><a href="/magic-dimension/">Dimension</a></td><td align="center">4</td><td align="center">§11A8</td></tr><tr data-search="mature plant wood rapidly mature a plant (so that it undergoes the equivalent of five years of growth during ten minutes)."><td><a href="/magic-wood/#app-mature-plant">Mature Plant</a></td><td><a href="/magic-wood/">Wood</a></td><td align="center">2</td><td align="center">§25A5</td></tr><tr data-search="mend wound essence the invoker may reduce a target's wound level by one (eg. from 6 to 5, or from 8 to 7) by reducing his/her own trained endurance level by one, and by acquiring two wound levels. (a corpse's wound status is considered to deteriorate — ie. increase — by one per day after death, at least for purposes of this rule.) the target must be of the invoker's race."><td><a href="/magic-essence/#app-mend-wound">Mend Wound</a></td><td><a href="/magic-essence/">Essence</a></td><td align="center">4</td><td align="center">§14A11</td></tr><tr data-search="mend wound (any race) essence as mend wound (§14a11), but the target may be of any race."><td><a href="/magic-essence/#app-mend-wound-any-race">Mend Wound (Any Race)</a></td><td><a href="/magic-essence/">Essence</a></td><td align="center">5</td><td align="center">§14A14</td></tr><tr data-search="mimic scent scent simulate the scent of some object or creature, sufficient to fool a person, within a 5m×5m×5m volume (controlled)."><td><a href="/magic-scent/#app-mimic-scent">Mimic Scent</a></td><td><a href="/magic-scent/">Scent</a></td><td align="center">1</td><td align="center">§15B4</td></tr><tr data-search="mimic scent (hound-proof) scent simulate the scent of some sort of object or creature, sufficiently well to fool a dog, within a 5m×5m×5m volume (controlled)."><td><a href="/magic-scent/#app-mimic-scent-hound-proof">Mimic Scent (Hound-proof)</a></td><td><a href="/magic-scent/">Scent</a></td><td align="center">2</td><td align="center">§15A6</td></tr><tr data-search="mind transfer sandestin the invoker may transfer his/her mind to another object or organism within range (retaining all knowledge and skills, although these may not be usable in the new body). if the target is non-sapient, then the invoker controls the organism (assuming it fails to resist) completely, extinguishing its &quot;soul&quot;. however, while in the body of a non-sapient organism, the invoker increases the intensity of any effect he/she attempts to invoke by two for incantations, and by four for rituals (on top of modifiers for lacking props); casting is unaffected. if the target is sapient, then the personality with lower wp (the more original personality, in the case of equal wps) is suppressed whenever the stronger is awake — except where the stronger personality attempts something greatly contrary to the interests of the weaker, in which case both make ef5 wp rolls, the better qr prevailing (a tie indicating the target's body is stunned for fifteen seconds or so, at which point another roll is made). a qr10 wp roll made in such circumstances causes the demise of the fumbling personality. a body left with no personality dies. a magician's mind in an inanimate object which is not a source of fatigue (such as a staff or fatigue battery) won't be able to produce any effects, even by casting. note that this application does not produce a &quot;sandestin&quot; as such. (range 20m; duration: instantaneous.) notes: this application requires a human brain as a prop. if transplanted into a body, this sandestin can use its mental skills, and its physical skills to a degree permitted by its new body (no problems if the new body is wholly superior). if stuck in an inanimate object, with no source of fatigue, then it will have to use casting at -2 or worse (for having no fatigue), or something. final notes: a sandestin may be treated as a target, or bestowee, for other applications in an effect of which it is part; it may be allocated a controlled, bestowed application and bestow it upon another target. if affected by a magical effect, and appropriately equipped, a §17a4 or §17a5 sandestin may resist said effect (they would require the incant skill). a sandestin may be attached to a prepared physical object or creature of sufficient size (gm's discretion as to what is sufficient; only one sandestin per object or creature); if the creature or object is destroyed, then the entire effect is lost. otherwise, a sandestin is assumed to occupy the location of its invoker at the time it was invoked. a sandestin may be assumed to react with the speed of its invoker (ie. not instantaneously) once preconditions for actions are met."><td><a href="/magic-sandestin/#app-mind-transfer">Mind Transfer</a></td><td><a href="/magic-sandestin/">Sandestin</a></td><td align="center">6</td><td align="center">§17A6</td></tr><tr data-search="minor apportation apportation perform sleight-of-hand tricks, move/teleport small balls, coin-sized objects, and the like, about his/her person (this over-rides normal range). (controlled.)"><td><a href="/magic-apportation/#app-minor-apportation">Minor Apportation</a></td><td><a href="/magic-apportation/">Apportation</a></td><td align="center">0</td><td align="center">§3B2</td></tr><tr data-search="minor divination divination determine the physical nature of an object; or the race, sex, and age of a character. (range: 10m.)"><td><a href="/magic-divination/#app-minor-divination">Minor Divination</a></td><td><a href="/magic-divination/">Divination</a></td><td align="center">0</td><td align="center">§7B1</td></tr><tr data-search="minor extension dimension increase by 50% the duration of any non-immediate magical effect of which this application is a part (fixed). (eg. an effect whose normal duration is 10 minutes would last 15 minutes if it had this application added.)"><td><a href="/magic-dimension/#app-minor-extension">Minor Extension</a></td><td><a href="/magic-dimension/">Dimension</a></td><td align="center">0</td><td align="center">§11B1</td></tr><tr data-search="mold substance form the invoker gains the ability to mould objects within range with his/her hands as though they were made of soft clay. if able to strike a target in combat with his/her bare hands while this is in effect, the damage inflicted is increased by 2 dcs, and ruins any armour made of rigid material protecting the location struck. (fixed.)"><td><a href="/magic-form/#app-mold-substance">Mold Substance</a></td><td><a href="/magic-form/">Form</a></td><td align="center">1</td><td align="center">§18B1</td></tr><tr data-search="mortal wound essence the invoker may increase a target's wound status by one, even if this kills it; otherwise this effect is identical to inflict wound (§22b2)."><td><a href="/magic-essence/#app-mortal-wound">Mortal Wound</a></td><td><a href="/magic-essence/">Essence</a></td><td align="center">2</td><td align="center">§22A9</td></tr><tr data-search="mortal wound (any race) essence as mortal wound (§22a9), but the target may be of any race."><td><a href="/magic-essence/#app-mortal-wound-any-race">Mortal Wound (Any Race)</a></td><td><a href="/magic-essence/">Essence</a></td><td align="center">3</td><td align="center">§22A14</td></tr><tr data-search="motor control compulsion allow the invoker to control a character's motor functions (ie. his/her movement, but not his/her thoughts; controlled). note that release of control causes the target to become rigid in the position last assumed until the application's duration elapses (how sad)."><td><a href="/magic-compulsion/#app-motor-control">Motor Control</a></td><td><a href="/magic-compulsion/">Compulsion</a></td><td align="center">3</td><td align="center">§6A6</td></tr><tr data-search="multiple sources sound all applications of sound may issue from multiple sources within range (instead of just one) by increasing their intensity. this is a sort of universal version."><td><a href="/magic-sound/#app-multiple-sources">Multiple Sources</a></td><td><a href="/magic-sound/">Sound</a></td><td align="center">4</td><td align="center">§19A16</td></tr><tr data-search="named summons summon give a specifically designated creature (one whose personal name and appearance can be uniquely specified), wherever it is on whatever plane, a desire to travel as quickly as it is safely able to the point the invoker occupied at the time of invocation (fixed)."><td><a href="/magic-summon/#app-named-summons">Named Summons</a></td><td><a href="/magic-summon/">Summon</a></td><td align="center">3</td><td align="center">§20A4</td></tr><tr data-search="neutra