 blow, a burn, a st9 grasp/push, or a bite (dc4, controlled)."><td><a href="/magic-touch/#app-painful-touch">Painful Touch</a></td><td><a href="/magic-touch/">Touch</a></td><td align="center">2</td><td align="center">§21A3</td></tr><tr data-search="permanence dimension render permanent any non-immediate magical effect of which this application is a part. any applications contained in an effect of which this application is part may be treated as bestowed (fixed). !!! note: after attempting (successfully or otherwise) the invocation of an effect including this application, the magician will be extremely fatigued, suffering a -1 modifier to all activity; to recover, he/she must pay 100 eps, and rest for at least one month, without interruption."><td><a href="/magic-dimension/#app-permanence">Permanence</a></td><td><a href="/magic-dimension/">Dimension</a></td><td align="center">5</td><td align="center">§11A9</td></tr><tr data-search="petrify earth petrify/unpetrify a living creature/statue. turn a living target to stone, or restore a &quot;stoned&quot; target to life. (duration: immediate.) note: this is an immediate rather than a permanent effect, so it can't be &quot;dispelled&quot;."><td><a href="/magic-earth/#app-petrify">Petrify</a></td><td><a href="/magic-earth/">Earth</a></td><td align="center">5</td><td align="center">§8A11</td></tr><tr data-search="planar summons summon give the nearest creature of a given description, so long as it is in the same plane as the invoker, a desire to travel as quickly as it is safely able to the point the invoker occupied at the time of invocation (fixed)."><td><a href="/magic-summon/#app-planar-summons">Planar Summons</a></td><td><a href="/magic-summon/">Summon</a></td><td align="center">2</td><td align="center">§20A3</td></tr><tr data-search="planar travel apportation cause an object massing no more than 100kg to be transferred instantly from one place to another, on any &quot;plane of existence&quot;. the same notes and limitations apply to this as to teleportation (§3a9), above. (immediate.) !!!"><td><a href="/magic-apportation/#app-planar-travel">Planar Travel</a></td><td><a href="/magic-apportation/">Apportation</a></td><td align="center">6</td><td align="center">§3A10</td></tr><tr data-search="poisonous vapours air create a volume of poisonous vapour occupying a volume 1m×1m×1m (fixed). those breathing the gas must successfully perform a pr roll or suffer one point of damage each pulse thereafter, until achieving a qr1 or 2 on one of the pain resistance rolls."><td><a href="/magic-air/#app-poisonous-vapours">Poisonous Vapours</a></td><td><a href="/magic-air/">Air</a></td><td align="center">2</td><td align="center">§2A9</td></tr><tr data-search="proscription compulsion render a target unable to (voluntarily) perform a specific act — eg. use a particular weapon, enter a particular room, say a particular word, attack a particular person (bestowed, duration 1h)."><td><a href="/magic-compulsion/#app-proscription">Proscription</a></td><td><a href="/magic-compulsion/">Compulsion</a></td><td align="center">2</td><td align="center">§6A5</td></tr><tr data-search="protection against earth earth the invoker may protect him/herself, or one target, against the damaging effects of cold and drying, to the effect of reducing all such attacks causing damage through these qualities by 4 dcs, and by 2 dcs if they are among the effects involved (fixed, bestowed)."><td><a href="/magic-earth/#app-protection-against-earth">Protection against Earth</a></td><td><a href="/magic-earth/">Earth</a></td><td align="center">2</td><td align="center">§8A5</td></tr><tr data-search="protection against fire fire reduce all damage to one target not larger than 2m×2m×2m from fire, and other heating and/or drying effects, by 4 dcs (fixed, bestowed). damage inflicted via one or the other and something else (eg. lightning is hot and wet) is reduced by 2 dcs."><td><a href="/magic-fire/#app-protection-against-fire">Protection against Fire</a></td><td><a href="/magic-fire/">Fire</a></td><td align="center">1</td><td align="center">§12B3</td></tr><tr data-search="protection against illusions cancellation the invoker may provide a conscious target with complete protection against illusory damage caused by applications of the tactile sensations fundamental (bestowed)."><td><a href="/magic-cancellation/#app-protection-against-illusions">Protection against Illusions</a></td><td><a href="/magic-cancellation/">Cancellation</a></td><td align="center">2</td><td align="center">§4B3</td></tr><tr data-search="protection against magic cancellation the invoker may confer upon his/her target protection against magical damage (including illusory damage), by reducing such damage by four damage classes."><td><a href="/magic-cancellation/#app-protection-against-magic">Protection against Magic</a></td><td><a href="/magic-cancellation/">Cancellation</a></td><td align="center">2</td><td align="center">§4A13</td></tr><tr data-search="protection against water water the invoker may protect him/herself, or one target, against the damaging effects of cold and moisture, to the effect of reducing all such attacks causing damage through these qualities by 4 dcs, and by 2 dcs if they are among the effects involved (fixed, bestowed)."><td><a href="/magic-water/#app-protection-against-water">Protection against Water</a></td><td><a href="/magic-water/">Water</a></td><td align="center">1</td><td align="center">§24B4</td></tr><tr data-search="protection from air air the invoker may render him/herself or another more resistant to attacks which damage through heat or moistening, by reducing the dcs of said attacks by 4. if the attack damages through one of the two, and something else (eg. drying, like a fire-based attack), then this protection drops to a reduction in dc of 2."><td><a href="/magic-air/#app-protection-from-air">Protection from Air</a></td><td><a href="/magic-air/">Air</a></td><td align="center">1</td><td align="center">§2B7</td></tr><tr data-search="question divination gain a single-clause reply to a question of the invoker's choice. otherwise as per ask (§7a13). !!! the ramifications of these two applications are fairly broad, and a wise gm may wish to nobble them (see the note concerning applications marked '!!!'), or be extremely ornery in determining what constitutes a well-defined question. recommended reading for this includes h.w. fowler's modern english usage."><td><a href="/magic-divination/#app-question">Question</a></td><td><a href="/magic-divination/">Divination</a></td><td align="center">6</td><td align="center">§7A14</td></tr><tr data-search="quicken time quicken a target's metabolism (by 100%), increasing his/her speed and initiative bef by one (bestowed). this will have many effects if maintained for a prolonged period. it will affect the time between environment-related fatigue rolls, aging, nutritional requirements, day-night cycles, long-distance travel, the effects of disease, and a character's emotional makeup and interactions with other people."><td><a href="/magic-time/#app-quicken">Quicken</a></td><td><a href="/magic-time/">Time</a></td><td align="center">2</td><td align="center">§23A2</td></tr><tr data-search="ranged reshape form as reshape (§18b2), above, but the invoker need not touch the target of the effect, and the target resumes its original form after one minute. (immediate.) !!!"><td><a href="/magic-form/#app-ranged-reshape">Ranged Reshape</a></td><td><a href="/magic-form/">Form</a></td><td align="center">4</td><td align="center">§18A7</td></tr><tr data-search="reach dimension increase the range or one of the dimensional restrictions of an effect of which this application is a constituent by 25%. (eg. if the volume affected were 4×4×4, it could be increased to 4×5×4, or the effect's range could be increased by one quarter.) (fixed.)"><td><a href="/magic-dimension/#app-reach">Reach</a></td><td><a href="/magic-dimension/">Dimension</a></td><td align="center">0</td><td align="center">§10B1</td></tr><tr data-search="remove air air remove all the air or vapour from a 2m×2m×2m volume (immediate). this won't suffocate people, but it can produce thunderclaps, slam doors, etc."><td><a href="/magic-air/#app-remove-air">Remove Air</a></td><td><a href="/magic-air/">Air</a></td><td align="center">1</td><td align="center">§2B2</td></tr><tr data-search="remove backfire essence the invoker may remove the effects of a magical backfire (other than an effect reversal) from him/herself or his/her target."><td><a href="/magic-essence/#app-remove-backfire">Remove Backfire</a></td><td><a href="/magic-essence/">Essence</a></td><td align="center">4</td><td align="center">§14A12</td></tr><tr data-search="reshape form the invoker gains the ability to reshape any one object he/she touches into any form into which it could be deformed — were it made of clay (and given any amount of time and craftsmanship) — by force of will, almost instantly. the change is permanent. (immediate.) among magicians, this might constitute an artistic medium."><td><a href="/magic-form/#app-reshape">Reshape</a></td><td><a href="/magic-form/">Form</a></td><td align="center">2</td><td align="center">§18A2</td></tr><tr data-search="rouse essence the invoker may immediately unstun one target (who must be of the invoker's race)."><td><a href="/magic-essence/#app-rouse">Rouse</a></td><td><a href="/magic-essence/">Essence</a></td><td align="center">0</td><td align="center">§14B2</td></tr><tr data-search="rouse (any race) essence as rouse (§14b2), but the target may be of any race."><td><a href="/magic-essence/#app-rouse-any-race">Rouse (Any Race)</a></td><td><a href="/magic-essence/">Essence</a></td><td align="center">1</td><td align="center">§14B4</td></tr><tr data-search="scent control scent create or suppress an odour or taste as desired within range, not so strong as to be nauseating (fixed)."><td><a href="/magic-scent/#app-scent-control">Scent Control</a>