tongue</a></td><td><a href="/magic-communication/">Communication</a></td><td align="center">2</td><td align="center">§5B3</td></tr><tr data-search="silvertongue compulsion force one character to believe everything the invoker tells him/her, no matter how outrageous, and act upon those beliefs. if told contradictory things, the affected character will either go insane (think like hal), or catatonic, until the effect wears off — and the character may make rational judgements on what he/she was told, probably unjustly biased by circumstances (fixed, bestowed)."><td><a href="/magic-compulsion/#app-silvertongue">Silvertongue</a></td><td><a href="/magic-compulsion/">Compulsion</a></td><td align="center">4</td><td align="center">§6A8</td></tr><tr data-search="simple abeyance abeyance delay the whole or a part of the magical effect of which this application is part by up to 30s (fixed, bestowed)."><td><a href="/magic-abeyance/#app-simple-abeyance">Simple Abeyance</a></td><td><a href="/magic-abeyance/">Abeyance</a></td><td align="center">0</td><td align="center">§1B1</td></tr><tr data-search="simple odour scent a waft of a simple odour or flavour (sweet, sour, bitter, saline; fixed)."><td><a href="/magic-scent/#app-simple-odour">Simple Odour</a></td><td><a href="/magic-scent/">Scent</a></td><td align="center">0</td><td align="center">§15B1</td></tr><tr data-search="simple sandestin sandestin place the controlled aspects of the magical effect of which this application is a part under the control of a simple program which is only able to perceive time. the program must comprise a series of simple, non-conditional, imperative clauses — eg. &quot;move north for five seconds&quot;, &quot;move 10 metres north&quot;, &quot;move around in a circle slowly three times&quot;, or even &quot;dart about randomly&quot; — but not something like &quot;walk to the end of the corridor&quot; (fixed, bestowed)."><td><a href="/magic-sandestin/#app-simple-sandestin">Simple Sandestin</a></td><td><a href="/magic-sandestin/">Sandestin</a></td><td align="center">0</td><td align="center">§17B1</td></tr><tr data-search="skilled sandestin sandestin as above, but the sandestin will also possess (up to) three skills of the invoker's choice, possessed by the invoker, whose formulae do not incorporate in, with the same pcs and bef as the invoker."><td><a href="/magic-sandestin/#app-skilled-sandestin">Skilled Sandestin</a></td><td><a href="/magic-sandestin/">Sandestin</a></td><td align="center">2</td><td align="center">§17A3</td></tr><tr data-search="sleep compulsion cause a target (who/which must normally sleep at some time) to fall asleep, for an hour or until awoken (immediate, fixed, bestowed)."><td><a href="/magic-compulsion/#app-sleep">Sleep</a></td><td><a href="/magic-compulsion/">Compulsion</a></td><td align="center">2</td><td align="center">§6A4</td></tr><tr data-search="slow time slow a target's metabolism (by 50%), reducing his/her/its speed and initiative bef by one (bestowed**)."><td><a href="/magic-time/#app-slow">Slow</a></td><td><a href="/magic-time/">Time</a></td><td align="center">1</td><td align="center">§23B1</td></tr><tr data-search="sounds of burning sound sounds of burning — hissing, crackling, etc. (controlled)."><td><a href="/magic-sound/#app-sounds-of-burning">Sounds of Burning</a></td><td><a href="/magic-sound/">Sound</a></td><td align="center">1</td><td align="center">§19B9</td></tr><tr data-search="spoil scent sour beer, spoil the flavour of a meal, or render a flower odourless (fixed)."><td><a href="/magic-scent/#app-spoil">Spoil</a></td><td><a href="/magic-scent/">Scent</a></td><td align="center">0</td><td align="center">§15B2</td></tr><tr data-search="stasis field time create a stasis field no larger than 5m×5m×5m. all creatures and objects within are (unless immunised) in stasis, and cannot act or be harmed in any fashion. all creatures and objects outside are (unless immunised) unable to enter the field. !!!"><td><a href="/magic-time/#a