ft/">Spacecraft</a></td><td align="center">—</td><td align="center">—</td></tr><tr data-search="greatsword weapon two-handed blade. more reach and bite; no hand free for a shield."><td><a href="/weapons/#weapon-greatsword">Greatsword</a></td><td><a href="/weapons/">Weapon</a></td><td align="center">1</td><td align="center">120</td></tr><tr data-search="hand grenade weapon blast in a radius — no aim roll against a point, a scatter roll against an area. fragmentation ignores light cover."><td><a href="/weapons/#weapon-hand-grenade">Hand Grenade</a></td><td><a href="/weapons/">Weapon</a></td><td align="center">5</td><td align="center">40</td></tr><tr data-search="helicopter vehicle vertical take-off, hover, and land where there's no runway. skilled to fly, thirsty, and loud enough to end any surprise."><td><a href="/vehicles/#vehicle-helicopter">Helicopter</a></td><td><a href="/vehicles/">Vehicle</a></td><td align="center">5</td><td align="center">500k</td></tr><tr data-search="knife / dagger weapon short blade — concealable, pierces armor, doubles as a tool and a thrown weapon. the floor of every weapon list."><td><a href="/weapons/#weapon-knife-dagger">Knife / Dagger</a></td><td><a href="/weapons/">Weapon</a></td><td align="center">0</td><td align="center">5</td></tr><tr data-search="laser rifle weapon line-of-sight beam weapon — flat trajectory, hungry for cells, dimmed by smoke and fog."><td><a href="/weapons/#weapon-laser-rifle">Laser Rifle</a></td><td><a href="/weapons/">Weapon</a></td><td align="center">7</td><td align="center">2k</td></tr><tr data-search="laspistol weapon energy sidearm: no recoil, no ballistic drop, a power cell instead of a magazine. the sf echo of the 9mm."><td><a href="/weapons/#weapon-laspistol">Laspistol</a></td><td><a href="/weapons/">Weapon</a></td><td align="center">7</td><td align="center">1k</td></tr><tr data-search="leather armor hardened hide. turns blunt force better than edges; no real penalty to wear all day."><td><a href="/armor/#armor-leather">Leather</a></td><td><a href="/armor/">Armor</a></td><td align="center">1</td><td align="center">60</td></tr><tr data-search="light aircraft vehicle small fixed-wing plane — needs a strip to land, uses terrain value only against where it puts down."><td><a href="/vehicles/#vehicle-light-aircraft">Light Aircraft</a></td><td><a href="/vehicles/">Vehicle</a></td><td align="center">5</td><td align="center">200k</td></tr><tr data-search="light freighter spacecraft the scoundrel's ship — small hold, oversized engines, a gun turret, and a hyperdrive that's always one bad roll from failing. the party's home."><td><a href="/spacecraft/#craft-light-freighter">Light Freighter</a></td><td><a href="/spacecraft/">Spacecraft</a></td><td align="center">—</td><td align="center">—</td></tr><tr data-search="lock picks gear a roll of tension wrenches and picks. without them, opening a lock is a penalty or flatly impossible; with them it's a skill roll."><td><a href="/tools/#tool-lock-picks">Lock Picks</a></td><td><a href="/tools/">Gear</a></td><td align="center">2</td><td align="center">50</td></tr><tr data-search="mace / club weapon impact rather than edge — cheap, and it doesn't care how good your armor's edge-turning is."><td><a href="/weapons/#weapon-mace-club">Mace / Club</a></td><td><a href="/weapons/">Weapon</a></td><td align="center">0</td><td align="center">25</td></tr><tr data-search="machine gun weapon belt-fed area denial — see fire combat. emplaced or bipod; suppresses ground you never actually hit."><td><a href="/weapons/#weapon-machine-gun">Machine Gun</a></td><td><a href="/weapons/">Weapon</a></td><td align="center">5</td><td align="center">4000</td></tr><tr data-search="mail armor interlinked rings — excellent against cuts, poor against crushing impact (that's what the padding under it is for)."><td><a href="/armor/#armor-mail">Mail</a></td><td><a href="/armor/">Armor</a></td><td align="center">2</td><td align="center">400</td></tr><tr data-search="mass-shunt tug spacecraft foresight's original ftl: the mass shunt throws a ship between fixed points (a magic gate serves the same role in a fantasy-sf setting). torch drive does everything in-system; the shunt links the stars."><td><a href="/spacecraft/#craft-mass-shunt-tug">Mass-Shunt Tug</a></td><td><a href="/spacecraft/">Spacecraft</a></td><td align="center">—</td><td align="center">—</td></tr><tr data-search="medical kit gear field trauma kit. a pm to first aid; a fuller surgeon's kit reaches surgery. without it, treating a serious wound takes a penalty — see the fields hierarchy."><td><a href="/tools/#tool-medical-kit">Medical Kit</a></td><td><a href="/tools/">Gear</a></td><td align="center">5</td><td align="center">300</td></tr><tr data-search="medscanner gear handheld diagnostic — reads vitals, names the injury, guides the treatment. a strong pm to the diagnosis half of medicine; you still have to do the fixing."><td><a href="/tools/#tool-medscanner">Medscanner</a></td><td><a href="/tools/">Gear</a></td><td align="center">7</td><td align="center">5k</td></tr><tr data-search="motorcycle vehicle fast, nimble, exposed. best maneuver rating on the road and no protection at all when it goes wrong."><td><a href="/vehicles/#vehicle-motorcycle">Motorcycle</a></td><td><a href="/vehicles/">Vehicle</a></td><td align="center">5</td><td align="center">8k</td></tr><tr data-search="nightvision goggles gear light-intensifying or thermal optics — the flashlight's advantage without the flashlight's giveaway. foiled by total dark (needs ir) or by smoke."><td><a href="/tools/#tool-nightvision-goggles">Nightvision Goggles</a></td><td><a href="/tools/">Gear</a></td><td align="center">6</td><td align="center">1500</td></tr><tr data-search="off-road (4×4) vehicle trades top speed for a terrain value that laughs at mud and rock. the expedition workhorse."><td><a href="/vehicles/#vehicle-off-road-4-4">Off-Road (4×4)</a></td><td><a href="/vehicles/">Vehicle</a></td><td align="center">5</td><td align="center">35k</td></tr><tr data-search="padded / gambeson armor quilted cloth — cheap, quiet, and the layer worn under heavier armor. barely there, but better than skin."><td><a href="/armor/#armor-padded-gambeson">Padded / Gambeson</a></td><td><a href="/armor/">Armor</a></td><td align="center">0</td><td align="center">20</td></tr><tr data-search="pistol (9mm) weapon the dc-8 anchor. self-loading, high-capacity magazine — the default modern handgun."><td><a href="/weapons/#weapon-pistol-9mm">Pistol (9mm)</a></td><td><a href="/weapons/">Weapon</a></td><td align="center">5</td><td align="center">400</td></tr><tr data-search="plate armor articulated full plate — the best pre-gunpowder protection. heavy, dulls perception in the helm, and every joint is an adjective."><td><a href="/armor/#armor-plate">Plate</a></td><td><a href="/armor/">Armor</a></td><td align="center">3</td><td align="center">1500</td></tr><tr data-search="powered armor armor motorized exoskeleton — the servos carry the weight and add strength, so the penalty inverts. uses damage scale; a walking vehicle you wear."><td><a href="/armor/#armor-powered-armor">Powered Armor</a></td><td><a href="/armor/">Armor</a></td><td align="center">8</td><td align="center">40k</td></tr><tr data-search="quarterstaff weapon two-handed staff: reach, a good parry pm, and it's just a stick when the guards ask."><td><a href="/weapons/#weapon-quarterstaff">Quarterstaff</a></td><td><a href="/weapons/">Weapon</a></td><td align="center">0</td><td align="center">5</td></tr><tr data-search="radio / comm gear two-way voice at range — the thing that makes split-the-party survivable. jammable, interceptable, and only as private as its encryption."><td><a href="/tools/#tool-radio-comm">Radio / Comm</a></td><td><a href="/tools/">Gear</a></td><td align="center">5</td><td align="center">200</td></tr><tr data-search="revolver weapon reliable double-action sidearm; six shots, slow to reload. cut-down makes it a concealable snub-nose."><td><a href="/weapons/#weapon-revolver">Revolver</a></td><td><a href="/weapons/">Weapon</a></td><td align="center">4</td><td align="center">300</td></tr><tr data-search="riding horse vehicle the original vehicle — self-fuelling, cross-country, and a character in its own right. a warhorse (destrier) is one adjective on this noun."><td><a href="/vehicles/#vehicle-riding-horse">Riding Horse</a></td><td><a href="/vehicles/">Vehicle</a></td><td align="center">0</td><td align="center">300</td></tr><tr data-search="riot gear armor built for impact — batons, thrown objects, crowds. great against blunt force, indifferent to bullets and blades."><td><a href="/armor/#armor-riot-gear">Riot Gear</a></td><td><a href="/armor/">Armor</a></td><td align="center">6</td><td align="center">800</td></tr><tr data-search="rope (15 m) gear fifteen metres of cordage. improves a climb, rigs a haul, ties a prisoner — the multi-tool of the pre-modern kit."><td><a href="/tools/#tool-rope-15-m">Rope (15 m)</a></td><td><a href="/tools/">Gear</a></td><td align="center">0</td><td align="center">10</td></tr><tr data-search="sailing ship vehicle wind-powered blue-water vessel — crew-hungry, weather-dependent, and the reason the map has other continents on it."><td><a href="/vehicles/#vehicle-sailing-ship">Sailing Ship</a></td><td><a href="/vehicles/">Vehicle</a></td><td align="center">2</td><td align="center">50k</td></tr><tr data-search="sedan vehicle the default car. sporty, luxury, police, and cheap/rusty are all adjectives — see the vehicle modification table."><td><a href="/vehicles/#vehicle-sedan">Sedan</a></td><td><a href="/vehicles/">Vehicle</a></td><td align="center">5</td><td align="center">25k</td></tr><tr data-search="shield armor not worn but wielded — a parry pm and cover you can point at the threat. costs you a hand; see melee combat."><td><a href="/armor/#armor-shield">Shield</a></td><td><a href="/armor/">Armor</a></td><td align="center">0</td><td align="center">40</td></tr><tr data-search="shotgun weapon brutal and forgiving up close; falls off fast. cut-down trades the last of its range for concealment."><td><a href="/weapons/#weapon-shotgun">Shotgun</a></td><td><a href="/weapons/">Weapon</a></td><td align="center">4</td><td align="center">350</td></tr><tr data-search="shuttle / runabout spacecraft the away-team car — atmosphere-capable, modest warp, the vehicle that actually gets characters to the surface."><td><a href="/spacecraft/#craft-shuttle-runabout">Shuttle / Runabout</a></td><td><a href="/spacecraft/">Spacecraft</a></td><td align="center">—</td><td align="center">—</td></tr><tr data-search="sniper rifle weapon precision, optics, and armor-piercing reach. a patient specialist's tool, not a firefight weapon."><td><a href="/weapons/#weapon-sniper-rifle">Sniper Rifle</a></td><td><a href="/weapons/">Weapon</a></td><td align="center">5</td><td align="center">2500</td></tr><tr data-search="spear weapon reach weapon that pierces. set against a charge it counts double. a thrown spear is the same noun, one adjective."><td><a href="/weapons/#weapon-spear">Spear</a></td><td><a href="/weapons/">Weapon</a></td><td align="center">0</td><td align="center">20</td></tr><tr data-search="speedboat vehicle planing hull — fast on flat water, brutal in chop. the chase vehicle for anywhere with a coastline."><td><a href="/vehicles/#vehicle-speedboat">Speedboat</a></td><td><a href="/vehicles/">Vehicle</a></td><td align="center">5</td><td align="center">40k</td></tr><tr data-search="stun pistol weapon non-lethal takedown — damage feeds a pain resistance / stun check rather than a wound. short-ranged by design."><td><a href="/weapons/#weapon-stun-pistol">Stun Pistol</a></td><td><a href="/weapons/">Weapon</a></td><td align="center">7</td><td align="center">700</td></tr><tr data-search="submachine gun weapon pistol round, automatic fire. devastating up close, thirsty and wild at range."><td><a href="/weapons/#weapon-submachine-gun">Submachine Gun</a></td><td><a href="/weapons/">Weapon</a></td><td align="center">4</td><td align="center">600</td></tr><tr data-search="sword weapon the arming sword — one-handed cut-and-thrust. fine, great, and short are all adjectives on this one noun."><td><a href="/weapons/#weapon-sword">Sword</a></td><td><a href="/weapons/">Weapon</a></td><td align="center">1</td><td align="center">60</td></tr><tr data-search="system fighter spacecraft single-seat dogfighter. space is an ocean and this is a spitfire — banks, stalls, and turns like an aeroplane because the setting wants it to. hyperdrive for the jump between scenes."><td><a href="/spacecraft/#craft-system-fighter">System Fighter</a></td><td><a href="/spacecraft/">Spacecraft</a></td><td align="center">—</td><td align="center">—</td></tr><tr data-search="tactical armor armor soft armor plus rifle-rated hard plates. bulky, hot, and the difference between a wound level and a funeral."><td><a href="/armor/#armor-tactical-armor">Tactical Armor</a></td><td><a href="/armor/">Armor</a></td><td align="center">6</td><td align="center">1200</td></tr><tr data-search="toolkit gear general mechanical tools. repair needs the diagnosis and the tools; this is the tools. a specialist kit gives more for its one trade."><td><a href="/tools/#tool-toolkit">Toolkit</a></td><td><a href="/tools/">Gear</a></td><td align="center">4</td><td align="center">250</td></tr><tr data-search="torch / flashlight gear portable light. removes the crippling penalty of acting blind — at the cost of announcing exactly where you are."><td><a href="/tools/#tool-torch-flashlight">Torch / Flashlight</a></td><td><a href="/tools/">Gear</a></td><td align="center">0</td><td align="center">5</td></tr><tr data-search="torch freighter spacecraft hard-sf hauler à la foresight's own physics (and the expanse): you burn toward your target, flip at the midpoint, and burn to stop. no ftl — the solar system is the setting."><td><a href="/spacecraft/#craft-torch-freighter">Torch Freighter</a></td><td><a href="/spacecraft/">Spacecraft</a></td><td align="center">—</td><td align="center">—</td></tr><tr data-search="truck vehicle heavy road hauler. slow to accelerate, ponderous to turn, and it carries what nothing else here can."><td><a href="/vehicles/#vehicle-truck">Truck</a></td><td><a href="/vehicles/">Vehicle</a></td><td align="center">5</td><td align="center">60k</td></tr><tr data-search="vacc suit gear sealed pressure suit with hours of air. turns 'the airlock opened' from a death into an inconvenience; clumsy enough to carry an agility penalty."><td><a href="/tools/#tool-vacc-suit">Vacc Suit</a></td><td><a href="/tools/">Gear</a></td><td align="center">6</td><td align="center">3k</td></tr></tbody></table></foresight-table>
