enter">5</td><td align="center">300</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#tool-toolkit">Toolkit</a></td><td>Repair &amp; Craft tasks</td><td align="center">+1</td><td align="center">4</td><td align="center">250</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#tool-radio-comm">Radio / Comm</a></td><td>communication beyond earshot</td><td align="center">—</td><td align="center">5</td><td align="center">200</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#tool-datapad">Datapad</a></td><td>research, records, hacking</td><td align="center">+1</td><td align="center">6</td><td align="center">800</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#tool-nightvision-goggles">Nightvision Goggles</a></td><td>seeing in the dark (silently)</td><td align="center">+1</td><td align="center">6</td><td align="center">1500</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#tool-vacc-suit">Vacc Suit</a></td><td>surviving vacuum &amp; hostile atmospheres</td><td align="center">—</td><td align="center">6</td><td align="center">3k</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#tool-medscanner">Medscanner</a></td><td>diagnosis (First Aid / Medicine)</td><td align="center">+2</td><td align="center">7</td><td align="center">5k</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="ev-cards"><section class="ev-card" id="tool-10-foot-pole"><h3>10-Foot Pole</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Helps with</dt><dd>probing floors, reaching from safety</dd><dt>PM</dt><dd>+1</dd><dt>Weight</dt><dd>2</dd><dt>TL</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>Price</dt><dd>2</dd><dt>Tags</dt><dd>standard, ancient, fantasy</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">A long stick — for prodding suspicious flagstones, pit lids, and tripwires from a body-length away. The item every dungeon list forgot to explain.</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="tool-rope-15-m"><h3>Rope (15 m)</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Helps with</dt><dd>climbing, hauling, binding</dd><dt>PM</dt><dd>+1</dd><dt>Weight</dt><dd>3</dd><dt>TL</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>Price</dt><dd>10</dd><dt>Tags</dt><dd>standard, ancient, fantasy</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Fifteen metres of cordage. Improves a climb, rigs a haul, ties a prisoner — the multi-tool of the pre-modern kit.</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="tool-lock-picks"><h3>Lock Picks</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Helps with</dt><dd>defeating mechanical locks</dd><dt>PM</dt><dd>+1</dd><dt>Weight</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>TL</dt><dd>2</dd><dt>Price</dt><dd>50</dd><dt>Tags</dt><dd>standard, ancient, modern, fantasy</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">A roll of tension wrenches and picks. Without them, opening a lock is a penalty or flatly impossible; with them it's a skill roll.</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="tool-torch-flashlight"><h3>Torch / Flashlight</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Helps with</dt><dd>seeing in the dark</dd><dt>PM</dt><dd>—</dd><dt>Weight</dt><dd>0.3</dd><dt>TL</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>Price</dt><dd>5</dd><dt>Tags</dt><dd>standard, ancient, modern, fantasy</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Portable light. Removes the crippling penalty of acting blind — at the cost of announcing exactly where you are.</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="tool-binoculars"><h3>Binoculars</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Helps with</dt><dd>spotting &amp; identifying at range</dd><dt>PM</dt><dd>+1</dd><dt>Weight</dt><dd>0.8</dd><dt>TL</dt><dd>4</dd><dt>Price</dt><dd>150</dd><dt>Tags</dt><dd>standard, modern</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Magnified optics. Turns a smudge on the horizon into a Scan roll you can actually make.</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="tool-climbing-kit"><h3>Climbing Kit</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Helps with</dt><dd>climbing sheer surfaces</dd><dt>PM</dt><dd>+1</dd><dt>Weight</dt><dd>4</dd><dt>TL</dt><dd>5</dd><dt>Price</dt><dd>200</dd><dt>Tags</dt><dd>standard, modern</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Harness, cams, carabiners, rope. Turns an unclimbable pitch into a hard climb, and a fall into a scare instead of a wound.</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="tool-medical-kit"><h3>Medical Kit</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Helps with</dt><dd>First Aid (and Surgery, well-stocked)</dd><dt>PM</dt><dd>+1</dd><dt>Weight</dt><dd>2</dd><dt>TL</dt><dd>5</dd><dt>Price</dt><dd>300</dd><dt>Tags</dt><dd>standard, modern</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Field trauma kit. A PM to First Aid; a fuller surgeon's kit reaches Surgery. Without it, treating a serious wound takes a penalty — see the Fields hierarchy.</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="tool-toolkit"><h3>Toolkit</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Helps with</dt><dd>Repair &amp; Craft tasks</dd><dt>PM</dt><dd>+1</dd><dt>Weight</dt><dd>6</dd><dt>TL</dt><dd>4</dd><dt>Price</dt><dd>250</dd><dt>Tags</dt><dd>standard, modern</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">General mechanical tools. Repair needs the diagnosis *and* the tools; this is the tools. A specialist kit gives more for its one trade.</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="tool-radio-comm"><h3>Radio / Comm</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Helps with</dt><dd>communication beyond earshot</dd><dt>PM</dt><dd>—</dd><dt>Weight</dt><dd>0.4</dd><dt>TL</dt><dd>5</dd><dt>Price</dt><dd>200</dd><dt>Tags</dt><dd>standard, modern</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Two-way voice at range — the thing that makes split-the-party survivable. Jammable, interceptable, and only as private as its encryption.</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="tool-datapad"><h3>Datapad</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Helps with</dt><dd>research, records, hacking</dd><dt>PM</dt><dd>+1</dd><dt>Weight</dt><dd>0.4</dd><dt>TL</dt><dd>6</dd><dt>Price</dt><dd>800</dd><dt>Tags</dt><dd>standard, modern, sf</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Handheld computer and network terminal. A PM to knowledge lookups, and the doorway to every system worth breaking into. Information-tech runs ahead of the rest of the tech scale.</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="tool-nightvision-goggles"><h3>Nightvision Goggles</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Helps with</dt><dd>seeing in the dark (silently)</dd><dt>PM</dt><dd>+1</dd><dt>Weight</dt><dd>0.5</dd><dt>TL</dt><dd>6</dd><dt>Price</dt><dd>1500</dd><dt>Tags</dt><dd>modern, sf</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Light-intensifying or thermal optics — the flashlight's advantage without the flashlight's giveaway. Foiled by total dark (needs IR) or by smoke.</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="tool-vacc-suit"><h3>Vacc Suit</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Helps with</dt><dd>surviving vacuum &amp; hostile atmospheres</dd><dt>PM</dt><dd>—</dd><dt>Weight</dt><dd>8</dd><dt>TL</dt><dd>6</dd><dt>Price</dt><dd>3k</dd><dt>Tags</dt><dd>sf</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Sealed pressure suit with hours of air. Turns 'the airlock opened' from a death into an inconvenience; clumsy enough to carry an Agility penalty.</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="tool-medscanner"><h3>Medscanner</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Helps with</dt><dd>diagnosis (First Aid / Medicine)</dd><dt>PM</dt><dd>+2</dd><dt>Weight</dt><dd>0.6</dd><dt>TL</dt><dd>7</dd><dt>Price</dt><dd>5k</dd><dt>Tags</dt><dd>sf</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Handheld diagnostic — reads vitals, names the injury, guides the treatment. A strong PM to the *diagnosis* half of medicine; you still have to do the fixing.</p></section></div></div></foresight-table>
</div>
