<div class="ev-static"><table class="ev-table"><thead><tr><th>Application</th><th align="center">Int</th><th align="center">§</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href="#app-lesser-earth-creation">Lesser Earth Creation</a></td><td align="center">0</td><td align="center">§8B1</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#app-create-earth">Create Earth</a></td><td align="center">1</td><td align="center">§8B2</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#app-create-steel">Create Steel</a></td><td align="center">1</td><td align="center">§8B3</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#app-greater-earth-creation">Greater Earth Creation</a></td><td align="center">2</td><td align="center">§8A4</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#app-protection-against-earth">Protection against Earth</a></td><td align="center">2</td><td align="center">§8A5</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#app-cone-of-withering">Cone of Withering</a></td><td align="center">2</td><td align="center">§8A6</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#app-create-gold">Create Gold</a></td><td align="center">2</td><td align="center">§8A7</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#app-create-gems">Create Gems</a></td><td align="center">3</td><td align="center">§8A8</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#app-summon-earth-elemental">Summon Earth Elemental</a></td><td align="center">3</td><td align="center">§8A9</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#app-entomb">Entomb</a></td><td align="center">5</td><td align="center">§8A10</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#app-petrify">Petrify</a></td><td align="center">5</td><td align="center">§8A11</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#app-animate-stone">Animate Stone</a></td><td align="center">5</td><td align="center">§8A12</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="ev-cards"><section class="ev-card" id="app-lesser-earth-creation"><h3>Lesser Earth Creation</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§8B1</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>earth</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Create/remove a volume of earth, gravel, rock, or sand (at rest — eg. in a pile on the ground, but not in the air or on an object unable to support it) occupying a volume no greater than 1m×1m×1m (<strong>fixed</strong>).</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-create-earth"><h3>Create Earth</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§8B2</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>earth</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Create/remove a volume of earth, gravel, rock, or sand (at rest — eg. in a pile on the ground, but not in the air or on an object unable to support it) no larger than 5m×5m×5m (<strong>fixed</strong>).</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-create-steel"><h3>Create Steel</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§8B3</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>earth</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Create/remove a volume of steel, or other (lighter) metal, larger than 1m×1m×1m (<strong>fixed</strong>).</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-greater-earth-creation"><h3>Greater Earth Creation</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>2</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§8A4</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>earth</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Create/remove a volume of earth, gravel, rock, or sand (at rest — eg. in a pile on the ground, but not in the air or on an object unable to support it) no larger than 20m×20m×20m (<strong>fixed</strong>).</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-protection-against-earth"><h3>Protection against Earth</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>2</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§8A5</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>earth</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">The invoker may protect him/herself, or one target, against the damaging effects of cold and drying, to the effect of reducing all such attacks causing damage through these qualities by 4 DCs, and by 2 DCs if they are among the effects involved (<strong>fixed, bestowed</strong>).</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-cone-of-withering"><h3>Cone of Withering</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>2</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§8A6</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>earth</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">The invoker may create a cone of withering (this is a drying attack) with its base anywhere within range. The cone is 6m wide at its base and draws to a point at its invoker. Those wholly or mostly within it suffer <strong>DC3</strong> from drying (<strong>immediate</strong>).</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-create-gold"><h3>Create Gold</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>2</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§8A7</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>earth</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Create/remove a volume of gold, lead, mercury, or other (lighter) metal, no larger than 20cm×20cm×20cm (<strong>fixed</strong>).</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-create-gems"><h3>Create Gems</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>3</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§8A8</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>earth</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Create/remove a volume of gems occupying a volume no greater than 10cm×10cm×10cm.</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-summon-earth-elemental"><h3>Summon Earth Elemental</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>3</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§8A9</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>earth</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Summon an elemental of earth (requires one cubic metre of earth, clay, or stone; <strong>controlled</strong>). The elemental appears in 2×(QR-1) pulses. See [5.2].</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-entomb"><h3>Entomb</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>5</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§8A10</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>earth</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Entomb any one object ≤2m×2m×2m in a lump of solid rock (roughly corresponding to its outline). This will suffocate most creatures. (Duration: infinite.)</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-petrify"><h3>Petrify</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>5</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§8A11</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>earth</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Petrify/unpetrify a living creature/statue. Turn a living target to stone, or restore a &quot;stoned&quot; target to life. (Duration: <strong>immediate</strong>.) Note: this is an immediate rather than a permanent effect, so it can't be &quot;dispelled&quot;.</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-animate-stone"><h3>Animate Stone</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>5</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§8A12</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>earth</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Animate a statue of a living creature ≤2m×2m×2m. The animated statue acts in every way like the &quot;real thing&quot;, with the exception of magical and similar special capabilities; other special effects, such as those of poisons, disappear once the animating effect's duration expires (<strong>bestowed</strong>).</p></section></div></div>
</div>
