r><td><a href="#app-inflict-pain-any-race">Inflict Pain (Any Race)</a></td><td align="center">2</td><td align="center">§22A8</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#app-mortal-wound">Mortal Wound</a></td><td align="center">2</td><td align="center">§22A9</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#app-fatigue-vessel">Fatigue Vessel</a></td><td align="center">3</td><td align="center">§14A9</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#app-mass-pain">Mass Pain</a></td><td align="center">3</td><td align="center">§22A10</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#app-greater-curse">Greater Curse</a></td><td align="center">3</td><td align="center">§22A11</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#app-steal-years">Steal Years</a></td><td align="center">3</td><td align="center">§22A12</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#app-steal-organ">Steal Organ</a></td><td align="center">3</td><td align="center">§22A13</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#app-mortal-wound-any-race">Mortal Wound (Any Race)</a></td><td align="center">3</td><td align="center">§22A14</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#app-drain-endurance">Drain Endurance</a></td><td align="center">3</td><td align="center">§22A15</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#app-mass-rouse">Mass Rouse</a></td><td align="center">4</td><td align="center">§14A10</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#app-mend-wound">Mend Wound</a></td><td align="center">4</td><td align="center">§14A11</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#app-remove-backfire">Remove Backfire</a></td><td align="center">4</td><td align="center">§14A12</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#app-transplant-organ">Transplant Organ</a></td><td align="center">4</td><td align="center">§14A13</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#app-drain-endurance-any-race">Drain Endurance (Any Race)</a></td><td align="center">4</td><td align="center">§22A16</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#app-curse">Curse</a></td><td align="center">4</td><td align="center">§22A17</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#app-mend-wound-any-race">Mend Wound (Any Race)</a></td><td align="center">5</td><td align="center">§14A14</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#app-neutralization">Neutralization</a></td><td align="center">5</td><td align="center">§14A15</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="ev-cards"><section class="ev-card" id="app-lend-vigor"><h3>Lend Vigor</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§14B1</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>instill</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">The invoker may transfer as many fatigue points as he/she wishes (and has) from him/herself to the target (who must be of the invoker's race) of the spell.</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-rouse"><h3>Rouse</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§14B2</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>instill</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">The invoker may immediately unstun one target (who must be of the invoker's race).</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-drain-vigor"><h3>Drain Vigor</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§22B1</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>tap</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">The invoker may transfer as many fatigue points from the target of the spell as he/she has (or fewer, if the invoker desires) to him/herself. The target of the effect must be of the invoker's race.</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-lend-vigor-any-race"><h3>Lend Vigor (Any Race)</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§14B3</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>instill</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">As Lend Vigor (§14B1), but the target may be of any race.</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-rouse-any-race"><h3>Rouse (Any Race)</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§14B4</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>instill</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">As Rouse (§14B2), but the target may be of any race.</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-take-wound"><h3>Take Wound</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§14B5</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>instill</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">The invoker may transfer one damage level from the target (who must be of the invoker's race) of the spell to him/herself, but not if the target is dead.</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-take-disease"><h3>Take Disease</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§14B6</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>instill</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">The invoker may transfer a disease or infection from a target of his/her own race to him/herself.</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-inflict-wound"><h3>Inflict Wound</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§22B2</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>tap</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">The invoker may transfer one wound level from him/herself to the target of the spell, or simply inflict a wound level upon the target, but not if this would kill the target outright. The target of the effect must be of the invoker's race.</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-inflict-disease"><h3>Inflict Disease</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§22B3</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>tap</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">The invoker may transfer a disease from him/herself to a target of his/her own race.</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-inflict-pain"><h3>Inflict Pain</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§22B4</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>tap</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">The invoker may cause pain to one target (who must be of the invoker's race), forcing the target to make a PR roll (modified by -1 per additional application simultaneously affecting the target) or become stunned — just as an S result does. (Range 10m.)</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-drain-vigor-any-race"><h3>Drain Vigor (Any Race)</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§22B5</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>tap</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">As Drain Vigor (§22B1), but the target may be of any race.</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-take-wound-any-race"><h3>Take Wound (Any Race)</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>2</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§14A7</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>instill</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">As Take Wound (§14B5), but the target may be of any race.</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-take-disease-any-race"><h3>Take Disease (Any Race)</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>2</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§14A8</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>instill</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">As Take Disease (§14B6), but the target may be of any race.</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-inflict-wound-any-race"><h3>Inflict Wound (Any Race)</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>2</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§22A6</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>tap</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">As Inflict Wound (§22B2), but the target may be of any race.</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-inflict-disease-any-race"><h3>Inflict Disease (Any Race)</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>2</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§22A7</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>tap</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">As Inflict Disease (§22B3), but the target may be of any race.</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-inflict-pain-any-race"><h3>Inflict Pain (Any Race)</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>2</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§22A8</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>tap</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">As Inflict Pain (§22B4), but the target may be of any race.</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-mortal-wound"><h3>Mortal Wound</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>2</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§22A9</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>tap</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">The invoker may increase a target's wound status by one, even if this kills it; otherwise this effect is identical to Inflict Wound (§22B2).</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-fatigue-vessel"><h3>Fatigue Vessel</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>3</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§14A9</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>instill</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">The invoker can instil a non-living object with a capacity to retain fatigue. Anyone holding the object (which feels as warm as flesh) can put fatigue into it, or draw fatigue from it, as an Action Point action. The object can hold a maximum of five points of fatigue. While this effect continues, the object is treated as a living thing capable of being &quot;killed&quot; (it has a DT appropriate to its size). If a sandestin application is combined with this effect, then the sandestin can utilise the fatigue points to perform, for example, incant actions. (Duration: 5 minutes.)</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-mass-pain"><h3>Mass Pain</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>3</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§22A10</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>tap</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">The invoker may cause pain to all within 10m, forcing all people and creatures in this region to make a PR roll (modified by -1 per additional application simultaneously affecting a given target) or become stunned.</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-greater-curse"><h3>Greater Curse</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>3</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§22A11</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>tap</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">The invoker may afflict his/her target with a magical backfire (roll on the Magical Backfire Table, treating any roll of 01-52 as: the target is stunned, and must recover normally).</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-steal-years"><h3>Steal Years</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>3</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§22A12</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>tap</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">The invoker may (permanently) reduce his/her physical age — including cancelling his/her growing senility, etc. — by transferring some of his/her years to targets of his/her race (but not beyond their maximum lifespans). The effect reduces the invoker's age by 2% while aging the targets by (n+2)% of the invoker's (true) age, where n is the percentage of his/her actual age that the invoker has removed by various means, or zero if this is higher (eg. if the invoker has him/herself been artificially aged). Eg. an invoker who is 150 years old, and has a physical age of 100 years, would be able to decrease his/her age by 2% (ie. 2 years) but would simultaneously increase the age of his/her target(s) by (33+2)% of 150 = 52.5 years (since he/she is 33% younger than he/she ought to be).</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-steal-organ"><h3>Steal Organ</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>3</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§22A13</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>tap</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">The invoker may regenerate one of his/her organs by demolishing that of his/her target (which must be intact), who must be a member of the invoker's race.</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-mortal-wound-any-race"><h3>Mortal Wound (Any Race)</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>3</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§22A14</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>tap</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">As Mortal Wound (§22A9), but the target may be of any race.</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-drain-endurance"><h3>Drain Endurance</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>3</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§22A15</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>tap</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">The invoker may drain a point from the trained EN of a target of his/her own race, and gain it for him/herself (ie. the target's trained EN drops, and the invoker's increases, by one point). The improvement is only temporary (Duration: 1 day) if the invoker's maximum trained EN is exceeded, or if the target's EN is lower than the invoker's.</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-mass-rouse"><h3>Mass Rouse</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>4</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§14A10</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>instill</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">The invoker may immediately unstun any or all targets within 10m (his/her discretion).</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-mend-wound"><h3>Mend Wound</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>4</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§14A11</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>instill</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">The invoker may reduce a target's wound level by one (eg. from 6 to 5, or from 8 to 7) by reducing his/her own trained endurance level by one, and by acquiring two wound levels. (A corpse's wound status is considered to deteriorate — ie. increase — by one per day after death, at least for purposes of this rule.) The target must be of the invoker's race.</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-remove-backfire"><h3>Remove Backfire</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>4</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§14A12</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>instill</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">The invoker may remove the effects of a magical backfire (other than an effect reversal) from him/herself or his/her target.</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-transplant-organ"><h3>Transplant Organ</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>4</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§14A13</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>instill</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">The invoker may transplant one of his/her organs to a target (of his/her race), displacing the original organ if applicable.</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-drain-endurance-any-race"><h3>Drain Endurance (Any Race)</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>4</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§22A16</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>tap</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">As Drain Endurance (§22A15), but the target may be of any PC race.</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-curse"><h3>Curse</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>4</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§22A17</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>tap</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">The invoker may inflict an intensity n curse upon his/her target (if lower than 3, the curse cannot be more severe than warts, boils, a toothache, a cold, or some other minor irritation), to the effect of: - causing the target to incur a -1 EF modifier to all of his/her tasks; or - causing the target to befall a stated doom at least 6−(intensity) months, or 10−(intensity) hours, or one hour (whichever is greater) away, in the form of a hazy prophecy (&quot;you shall die by the hand of a loved one&quot;, &quot;you shall become in shape as a toad, and only the loving kiss of royalty shall restore thee&quot;, etc.). The curse may not constrain the character's actions, other than by coming true sometime after the minimum time elapses. (Range 10m, <strong>fixed, bestowed</strong>.) !!!</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-mend-wound-any-race"><h3>Mend Wound (Any Race)</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>5</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§14A14</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>instill</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">As Mend Wound (§14A11), but the target may be of any race.</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-neutralization"><h3>Neutralization</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>5</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§14A15</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>instill</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">The invoker may neutralise a single magical effect of intensity ≤ n which is within 10m, but in doing so immediately suffers a backfire (roll D100 for type). If used to counter a curse, and a QR10 is achieved, the curse's intensity increases by one.</p></section></div></div>
</div>
