<div class="ev-static"><table class="ev-table"><thead><tr><th>Application</th><th align="center">Int</th><th align="center">§</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href="#app-flame">Flame</a></td><td align="center">0</td><td align="center">§12B1</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#app-bolt-of-fire">Bolt of Fire</a></td><td align="center">1</td><td align="center">§12B2</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#app-protection-against-fire">Protection against Fire</a></td><td align="center">1</td><td align="center">§12B3</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#app-fire">Fire</a></td><td align="center">1</td><td align="center">§12B4</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#app-ball-of-fire">Ball of Fire</a></td><td align="center">2</td><td align="center">§12A5</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#app-fire-storm">Fire Storm</a></td><td align="center">2</td><td align="center">§12A6</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#app-summon-fire-elemental">Summon Fire Elemental</a></td><td align="center">3</td><td align="center">§12A7</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#app-greater-fire-ball">Greater Fire Ball</a></td><td align="center">3</td><td align="center">§12A8</td></tr><tr><td><a href="#app-incineration">Incineration</a></td><td align="center">5</td><td align="center">§12A9</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="ev-cards"><section class="ev-card" id="app-flame"><h3>Flame</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§12B1</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>fire</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Create a flame equivalent to a torch (<strong>DC1</strong>; <strong>fixed, bestowed</strong>).</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-bolt-of-fire"><h3>Bolt of Fire</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§12B2</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>fire</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Create a bolt of flame which may be manipulated as a dagger, although it inflicts <strong>DC5</strong> (fire damage) on anyone cut by it, or holding it (<strong>fixed, bestowed</strong>).</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-protection-against-fire"><h3>Protection against Fire</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§12B3</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>fire</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Reduce all damage to one target not larger than 2m×2m×2m from fire, and other heating and/or drying effects, by 4 DCs (<strong>fixed, bestowed</strong>). Damage inflicted via one or the other and something else (eg. lightning is hot and wet) is reduced by 2 DCs.</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-fire"><h3>Fire</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§12B4</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>fire</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Create a flame equivalent to a large campfire, filling one hex (<strong>DC3</strong>, or <strong>DC1</strong> to three locations), and those adjacent to it (<strong>DC1</strong>; <strong>fixed, bestowed</strong>).</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-ball-of-fire"><h3>Ball of Fire</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>2</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§12A5</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>fire</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Create a fiery explosion (<strong>immediate, bestowed</strong>): - <strong>DC5</strong> to anyone in the hex targeted; - <strong>DC4</strong> to those in hexes adjacent to that hex; - <strong>DC2</strong> to those in hexes two hexes from it.</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-fire-storm"><h3>Fire Storm</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>2</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§12A6</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>fire</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Fill a volume up to 5m×5m×5m with flame inflicting <strong>DC3</strong> on those entering it (<strong>fixed, bestowed</strong>).</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-summon-fire-elemental"><h3>Summon Fire Elemental</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>3</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§12A7</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>fire</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Summon an elemental of fire (<strong>controlled</strong>). The elemental appears in 2×(QR-1) pulses. See [5.2].</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-greater-fire-ball"><h3>Greater Fire Ball</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>3</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§12A8</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>fire</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Create a fiery explosion (<strong>immediate, bestowed</strong>): - <strong>DC6</strong> to anyone in the hex targeted, or hexes adjacent to it; - <strong>DC4</strong> to anyone in hexes two hexes away; - <strong>DC2</strong> to anyone three hexes away.</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-incineration"><h3>Incineration</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>5</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§12A9</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>fire</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Intensely heat and dry one target within range (to the effect of causing it <strong>DC13</strong>, which is unlucky). (<strong>Immediate</strong>.)</p></section></div></div>
