ages</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Brighten or dim one lamp, equivalent to a torch or lantern (so that it becomes twice as bright, or ceases to give off light; <strong>controlled</strong>).</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-image-manipulation"><h3>Image Manipulation</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§13B4</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>images</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Alter the appearance of any object up to 5m×5m×5m without altering any of its dimensions or volume by more than 10% (<strong>controlled</strong>, so that the changed appearance may not only be altered, but seem to move, etc.).</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-bestowed-light"><h3>Bestowed Light</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§13B5</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>images</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Any Intensity 0 application, <strong>bestowed</strong>.</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-image-creation"><h3>Image Creation</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>2</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§13A6</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>images</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Create/remove an image up to 3m×3m×3m (<strong>controlled</strong>).</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-bestowed-image-manipulation"><h3>Bestowed Image Manipulation</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>2</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§13A7</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>images</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Any Intensity 1 application, <strong>bestowed</strong>.</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-bestowed-image-creation"><h3>Bestowed Image Creation</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>3</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§13A8</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>images</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Any Intensity 2 application, <strong>bestowed</strong>. Clarification: &quot;remove&quot; image actually means to replace an image with what the invoker (controller) believes would be seen were that image not present (ie. not the same as making the object transparent, with the refractive index of air). So a character could not, for example, see through a door by &quot;removing&quot; its image. The invoker might put a sandestin with eyesight and remove image into the door, and then see through it…</p></section></div></div>
