">4</td><td align="center">§19A16</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="ev-cards"><section class="ev-card" id="app-tinkling-bells"><h3>Tinkling Bells</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§19B1</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>sounds</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Tinkling of bells (<strong>controlled</strong>).</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-distant-singing"><h3>Distant Singing</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§19B2</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>sounds</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Distant singing, unintelligible (<strong>controlled</strong>).</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-whisper"><h3>Whisper</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§19B3</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>sounds</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">A whisper, automatically heard only by its target; others must make a Scan roll (<strong>controlled</strong>).</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-buzzing"><h3>Buzzing</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§19B4</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>sounds</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Buzzing (like that of a bee or fly) emanating from one point within range (<strong>controlled</strong>).</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-lesser-silence"><h3>Lesser Silence</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§19B5</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>sounds</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Silence any sound no louder than quiet speech (<strong>fixed</strong>).</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-silence"><h3>Silence</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§19B10</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>sounds</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Silence any sound no louder than raised voices (<strong>fixed</strong>).</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-bestowed-lesser-sound"><h3>Bestowed Lesser Sound</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§19B11</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>sounds</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Any Intensity 0 application, <strong>bestowed</strong>.</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-voice"><h3>Voice</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§19B6</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>sounds</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Audible voice (<strong>controlled</strong>).</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-animal-noises"><h3>Animal Noises</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§19B7</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>sounds</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Animal noises — roars, barks, clip-clops, neighs, etc. (<strong>controlled</strong>).</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-footsteps"><h3>Footsteps</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§19B8</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>sounds</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Sound of an unarmoured person — clothes rustling, footfalls, breathing, etc. (<strong>controlled</strong>).</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-sounds-of-burning"><h3>Sounds of Burning</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§19B9</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>sounds</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Sounds of burning — hissing, crackling, etc. (<strong>controlled</strong>).</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-thunderclap"><h3>Thunderclap</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>2</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§19A12</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>sounds</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Sound of a huge impact or explosion, or other sound of similar volume (<strong>controlled</strong>).</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-greater-silence"><h3>Greater Silence</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>2</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§19A13</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>sounds</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Silence any bearable sound (<strong>controlled</strong>).</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-bestowed-sound"><h3>Bestowed Sound</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>2</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§19A14</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>sounds</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Any Intensity 1 application, <strong>bestowed</strong>.</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-bestowed-greater-sound"><h3>Bestowed Greater Sound</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>3</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§19A15</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>sounds</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Any Intensity 2 application, <strong>bestowed</strong>.</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-multiple-sources"><h3>Multiple Sources</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>4</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§19A16</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>sounds</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">All applications of Sound may issue from multiple sources within range (instead of just one) by increasing their intensity. This is a sort of universal version.</p></section></div></div>
