"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>3</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§23A3</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>time</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Render a target immune to the effects of any of the other applications of the Time fundamental (<strong>bestowed</strong>). !!! Designer's Note: this is a fiddly application. As a rule, it can be made part of a magical effect, immunising the effect to applications of the Time fundamental. (Eg. an effect of long, but finite, duration could be temporarily neutralised by Stasis Field, §23A6, below, unless it had been immunised by this application.) On the other hand, while this immunisation would allow an effect to pass through a stasis field, it would not allow it to affect something within the stasis field.</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-hibernation"><h3>Hibernation</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>3</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§23A4</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>time</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Slow down the metabolism of a sleeping target by a factor of 100,000 (so that a year seems like a few minutes). (Duration: until awakened — naturally, or by being, for example, shaken.)</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-stasis-field"><h3>Stasis Field</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>4</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§23A5</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>time</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Create a stasis field no larger than 5m×5m×5m. All creatures and objects within are (unless immunised) in stasis, and cannot act or be harmed in any fashion. All creatures and objects outside are (unless immunised) unable to enter the field. !!!</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-age"><h3>Age</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>4</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§23A6</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>time</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Increase or reduce the age of a target by up to ten years. (Targets made older are aged, while those made younger also lose experience, skills, etc. Ie. when a target's age is reduced by X years, it becomes as it was X years ago, whereas increasing a target's age does not make it as it will be in X years, but as it might be were it to lie around — doing nothing and having nothing done to it — for that time.) Note that this application, as stated, is temporary, and reverses once the effect is ended (either by running out of time or being dispelled).</p></section><section class="ev-card" id="app-mass-age"><h3>Mass Age</h3><dl class="ev-fields"><dt>Intensity</dt><dd>4</dd><dt>Code</dt><dd>§23A6</dd><dt>Source</dt><dd>time</dd></dl><p class="ev-body">Age multiple targets, otherwise as Age (§23A6).</p></section></div></div>
